  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 300°F (150°C).",
    "In a large Dutch oven, heat the oil over medium heat. Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger; cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the pork and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
